{"data": [{"id": "2122127604916576345", "author_id": "42380349", "text": "@ceobrendan @garrytan Shit some captcha I’m looking at like wtf they want lol. Or is this two pixels of this object over the line count for this square.", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:40:22.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/SplinteredEsq/status/2122127604916576345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122119210373628204", "author_id": "1024969408907751424", "text": "@garrytan https://t.co/giLLQtuG4H", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:07:01.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Quentin_Car0n/status/2122119210373628204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122100409909334436", "author_id": "2100442135099305984", "text": "@garrytan agents reading and clicking is one thing. for anything touching money the real step is your limits travelling with the agent", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:19.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/getcompi/status/2122100409909334436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122096288971845745", "author_id": "2104993200490393600", "text": "@SplinteredEsq @garrytan Same. Authenticators and captchas are the last boss. Once agents can handle 2FA safely, it's a different game.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:35:56.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/ceobrendan/status/2122096288971845745", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122091251600400692", "author_id": "207325675", "text": "@garrytan Garry, I just listened to your interview with Walter. Your decision to make Aside Browser happen was absolutely incredible. Aside has been the most critically intelligent enabler in my personal computing history! @AsideAI", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:15:55.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/gammamukja/status/2122091251600400692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122088340010725776", "author_id": "1849466647154688022", "text": "@garrytan browser access is where most agents I've tried break. curious how it handles logins compared to the usual headless setup", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:04:21.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/themarcusjr/status/2122088340010725776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122047606545400304", "author_id": "1372212747883184132", "text": "@garrytan how does it handle DOM state mutation overhead under high agent concurrency?", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:22:29.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/OPuzanov/status/2122047606545400304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122036290862608401", "author_id": "1195508264668160001", "text": "@garrytan browsers r lowkey the real bottleneck for agents, not the model. headless chrome boot time adds up fast when u got hundreds of runs. we went w lightpanda in operator-starter for that exact reason, boots in like 15ms. curious how aside compares", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:37:31.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Rxdha1/status/2122036290862608401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122035114104287282", "author_id": "1932056551168045056", "text": "@garrytan The browser can be a cheaper way to discover the right automation, not just a different way to run it. A working trial gives the business evidence before it commits to custom integrations.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:32:51.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/aginaut/status/2122035114104287282", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122027343955071304", "author_id": "12377382", "text": "@AsideAI @garrytan Give us some early teasers! What are you working on V2?", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:01:58.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/gsmbk/status/2122027343955071304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122027145228939693", "author_id": "12377382", "text": "@garrytan I was literally talking about it with @amjadobeidat this morning!", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:01:11.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/gsmbk/status/2122027145228939693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122019846917386627", "author_id": "42380349", "text": "@ceobrendan @garrytan it doesn't have a problem with that; only when I hit an authenticator do I have an issue right now.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:32:11.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/SplinteredEsq/status/2122019846917386627", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122019278773776601", "author_id": "2069439130556116992", "text": "@SplinteredEsq @garrytan fair, 4.5. the reading was alays the billable part", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:29:55.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/OdysseyStack/status/2122019278773776601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122018730481996168", "author_id": "42380349", "text": "@OdysseyStack @garrytan 4.5*. Now you gotta read all the damn cases it locates and prints out.  AI is really good at using terms and connector searches that most folks just probably can't comprehend.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:27:45.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/SplinteredEsq/status/2122018730481996168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122015075921985770", "author_id": "2005897945317793795", "text": "@stevezhen98 @garrytan Here’s Aside in action: an AI browser built to turn your web tasks into work done 👀 https://t.co/fUWYg6932j", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:13:13.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Anijam_ai/status/2122015075921985770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "42380349", "username": "SplinteredEsq", "name": "Chris Baker", "verified": false}, {"id": "2104993200490393600", "username": "ceobrendan", "name": "Brendan Melanson", "verified": false}, {"id": "11768582", "username": "garrytan", "name": "Garry Tan", "verified": false}, {"id": "1024969408907751424", "username": "Quentin_Car0n", "name": "Quentin Caron", "verified": false}, {"id": "2100442135099305984", "username": "getcompi", "name": "compi", "verified": false}, {"id": "207325675", "username": "gammamukja", "name": "Anthony Cho", "verified": false}, {"id": "1781311066460557312", "username": "AsideAI", "name": "Aside", "verified": true}, {"id": "1849466647154688022", "username": "themarcusjr", "name": "MJ", "verified": false}, {"id": "1372212747883184132", "username": "OPuzanov", "name": "Alex Puzanov ❤️ AI Factory", "verified": false}, {"id": "1195508264668160001", "username": "Rxdha1", "name": "RYDA⚒️🧙🏾‍♂️🛸", "verified": false}, {"id": "1932056551168045056", "username": "aginaut", "name": "aginaut", "verified": false}, {"id": "12377382", "username": "gsmbk", "name": "Geo Morjane", "verified": false}, {"id": "52131063", "username": "amjadobeidat", "name": "Amjad Obeidat", "verifi